Package: shapeMetrics
Title: Shape and Compactness Metrics for Spatial Polygons
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Guilherme", "Correia", email="guilhermegcorreia9@gmail.com", role=c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a comprehensive set of shape and compactness indices 
    for polygon geometries (sf objects) with optional parallel computation. 
    Inspired by the 'vectormetrics' package (patch metrics) and the 
    'redistmetrics' package (compactness measures). All metrics are 
    re-implemented from scratch based on the original formulas.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    sf,
    future,
    future.apply
Suggests: 
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
URL: https://github.com/guilhermegcorreia9-sketch/shapeMetrics
BugReports: https://github.com/guilhermegcorreia9-sketch/shapeMetrics/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
